Promoted from P3 audit bundle #1193. Original findings:

`lib/features/feature_flags/data/repositories/feature_flags_repository_impl.dart:100-113`: local overrides (`feature_flag_override_<key>` in plain prefs) are honoured in release, although only a debug-only screen writes them, so an edited prefs file can flip a server kill switch (reproduced: remote false, override wins with `source: localOverride`). Criterion: overrides are read only while `AppConfig.enableDebugFeatures` holds, or the docs say release honours them on purpose; a test with debug features off sees the remote value.

## Acceptance criteria

- overrides are read only while `AppConfig.enableDebugFeatures` holds, or the docs say release honours them on purpose; a test with debug features off sees the remote value.
- Required host checks and applicable workflow dispatches pass; evidence names each criterion. Parent #1193 is checked only after this issue closes.

